<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has struck bases in Bahrain and set fire to an industrial facility there, while also launching missiles into the Strait of Hormuz. An athlete swam the length of the strait to draw attention to the environmental impact of the fighting, and a tracking site reported that a claimed Iranian tanker in the strait does not exist. Iran unveiled a dual-missile launcher and a new missile city, expanding its missile capabilities. Hakeem Jeffries pledged sanctions on violent West Bank settlers and an end to the Iran war. 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/11/24/irans-fight-for-wartime-redress-moves-from-battlefield-to-us-eu-courts?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/22/tanker-incident-involving-military-forces-reported-in-strait-of-hormuz&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPVnAyWjFhM0N6WkxvQzVvZVQzbENKemctbW1HWEhhaWhkMlFkeXRnZ3dySXFseXMzWmVQdm01UGU3OUt2MTYxT3JIS0VtVDRvWmgzejFnRGRBOFBQM3hpeUZoNlRDUjhTRnhMT2lJd2dOczJrZWlxN05hdGRqTVYyMXQyWkZrYVZrTTVEa09qZG53T2ZLSjlkcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
